Impact Structures includes code adapted from StructureLib
(GTNewHorizons/StructureLib, commit 0b5f4aa433e52fc8338e7f26ab520044bbb69c27).

StructureLib was originally developed by TecTech authors including Technus,
with subsequent contributions by glee8e and other StructureLib contributors.
The upstream project identifies the combined work as LGPL-3.0; the included
LICENSE and LICENSE.LESSER retain the upstream license texts.

IMPACT adaptations: namespace and API refactoring, independent color and service
hint systems, removal of GregTech integration, local item matching and tooltips,
optional NEI integration, and build/runtime configuration.
